### Configure these variables locally; never commit a real bearer token.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@accessToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY_WITH_DEMO_OR_EXTERNAL_ACCESS_TOKEN
@customerId = REPLACE_WITH_CUSTOMER_GUID
@vehicleId = REPLACE_WITH_OWNED_VEHICLE_GUID
@dealershipId = REPLACE_WITH_DEALERSHIP_GUID
@serviceTypeId = REPLACE_WITH_SERVICE_GUID
@startsAt = REPLACE_WITH_FUTURE_OFFSET_TIMESTAMP
@appointmentId = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_APPOINTMENT_GUID

### Local reviewer accounts (explicit Development reviewer mode only)
# Copy an accounts[].accessToken into accessToken above. Tokens expire after 1 hour.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/auth

### Anonymous liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Anonymous readiness (503 while DB/schema unavailable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Authenticated shared lookup
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dealerships
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Authenticated service durations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/service-types
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Admin only; also requires Development and Demo.Enabled
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/fixtures
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Customer: own collection only; Admin: selected customer's collection
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/{{customerId}}/vehicles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Advisory only. URL-encode '+' as '%2B' when using a numeric timestamp offset.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/availability?dealershipId={{dealershipId}}&serviceTypeId={{serviceTypeId}}&startsAt={{startsAt}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Book: expect 201 + Location, or 409 if capacity was consumed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "vehicleId": "{{vehicleId}}",
  "dealershipId": "{{dealershipId}}",
  "serviceTypeId": "{{serviceTypeId}}",
  "startsAt": "{{startsAt}}"
}

### Persisted readback; use response ID or Location, including after restarting API
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments/{{appointmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Filter is required; Customers may select only their mapped ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/appointments?customerId={{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Missing identity: expect 401 and WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dealerships
